<!DOCTYPE html>
<html data-theme="purple" data-font="Lato" lang="en">

<head>
  <%- include('../partials/head', { pageTitle: pageTitle }) %>
    <meta property="og:title" content="<%= pageTitle %>">
    <meta property="og:type" content="article">
    <meta property="og:description" content="Who the hell is Ujwal Wadhai? Find out more about the person behind this blog.">
    <meta name="description" content="Ujwal is a computer science student, developer and writer.">
    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "ProfilePage",
        "dateCreated": "2026-09-13",
        "dateModified": "2026-09-13",
        "mainEntity": {
          "@type": "Person",
          "name": "Ujwal Wadhai",
          "description": "Computer science student, developer and writer.",
          "url": "https://ujwalwadhai.me/about",
          "image": "https://ujwalwadhai.me/images/photo.jpeg",
          "sameAs": [
            "https://www.instagram.com/justtt_ujwal",
            "https://github.com/ujwalwadhai",
            "https://linkedin.com/in/ujwalwadhai"
          ]
        }
      }
    </script>
  </head>

<body>
  <%- include('../partials/navbar', { activePage: 'about' }) %>

  <main class="profile-page">

    <!-- Cover -->
    <div class="cover-photo" style="
      background:
        linear-gradient(
          rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4),
          rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4)
        ),
        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507525428034-b723cf961d3e?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1470&q=80')
        center center / cover no-repeat;
    "></div>


    <!-- Profile information -->
    <div class="profile-info-container">

      <div class="profile-photo">
        <img src="/images/photo.jpeg" alt="Ujwal Wadhai">
      </div>

      <div class="user-details">

        <p class="name">
          Ujwal Wadhai
        </p>

        <p class="bio">
          <span class="fal fa-microphone"></span> Mic check!!! <br><br>
          Hi, I'm Ujwal 😃
          <br><br>
          I'm a computer science student, developer, professional overthinker, and someone who has probably spent too
          much time overthinking things.
          <br><br>
          I like building things. Websites, apps, little designs, random ideas (that felt great at 2AM btw), and
          friendships too. I'm currently doing B. Tech. so most of my life revolves around code, assignments,
          debugging things, and wondering why the fuck I'm even doing this degree.
          <br><br>
          But this website isn't really my portfolio (or resume whatevah 😒).
          <br><br>
          It's more like my little diary. Yep I'm that guy who wrote diary.
          <br><br>
          I tend to have a lot of thoughts about completely unrelated things. I think a lot about college, future,
          philosophy, friendships etc. But people say it's overthinking (duhh).
          <br><br>
          So I thought, instead of letting all those thoughts just stay in my head, I could give them some space. Well that's the
          reason I made this website.
          I don't really have a theme for this blog. I can write about literally anything I want. That's kinda the point.
          <br><br>
          Anyways, that's pretty much about me.<br>
          I'm still figuring everything out in life. So for now, I'll just write.
          <br><br>
          -- Meeee (Ujwal Wadhai)
        </p>

        <div class="action-buttons">

          <a href="mailto:hello@ujwalwadhai.me" class="action-btn primary">
            <span class="fal fa-envelope"></span>
            Email
          </a>

          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/justtt_ujwal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="action-btn">
            <span class="fab fa-instagram"></span>
            Instagram
          </a>

          <p class="action-btn special">
            <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/ujwalwadhai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span
                class="fab fa-linkedin"></span></a>
            <a href="https://github.com/ujwalwadhai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span
                class="fab fa-github"></span></a>
          </p>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </main>

  <%- include('../partials/footer') %>

</body>

</html>